# Engineering System

Cursor compatibility adapter is DISABLED BY DEFAULT. Do not implement, resume a Cursor worker, or create/reuse a persistent Cursor session unless the owner explicitly reactivates Cursor for the current Work Packet and that packet records `IMPLEMENTER=CURSOR`. Otherwise stop and leave implementation to ChatGPT Chat.

Follow repository `AGENTS.md` and `.engineering/project.yaml` under the canonical Engineering System.

Use minimum sufficient context. On an existing branch/PR, inspect the diff first and expand only to required dependencies. Run the smallest correct change and cheapest affected deterministic check first; inspect actionable review feedback before merge.

Do not auto-run expensive/full-suite checks for metadata-only or narrowly scoped changes. Do not spend coding-agent time polling external waits or dumping large command output into context; save verbose logs and surface only exit status plus relevant grep/tail evidence.

Only after explicit owner reactivation for the current packet, reuse one healthy project persistent Cursor session across Work Packets. Reset context with `/clear` then `/work-resume`; create a new persistent session only when none is healthy, the current one is unusable, or admitted parallel work needs an isolated worker.
